5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am concerned about the actual purchasing power of the grant. I will check travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the facilities can actually handle the work! I'll check accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To avoid unforeseen delays, I'll examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and station records from partner field sites.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer empirical evidence of success. I will review closeout files of finished awards and national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
