50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"The candidates are A, B, C, and D. Given the staffing, A and B look strongest.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Midori,,"A is a catalogue, which Toshio likes, and B uses the glasshouses I found are well-funded.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"C needs spectroscopy, which is unreliable. D needs animal facilities, which are expensive now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A involves field sites, which are risky. B is controlled greenhouse trials. B is the most rational choice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"A's catalogue nature ensures long-term impact, but B's stability is tempting.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,"I lean toward B. The glasshouse crew is full, and it avoids the phenotyping technician shortage.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. B is balanced and the costs are currently absorbed by the ministry.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Kenji,,B sounds great! No broken machines or expensive animal rates to worry about.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,B avoids the schedule overruns associated with breeding colonies and the chaos of field sites.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"While I value the catalogue of A, the operational risks Benjamin noted make B the more certain delivery.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am happy with this harmony.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The logic is sound.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
